# After pad_bind_save.seq, on the same HOME and save folder: the profile
# loads and the pad's binding chosen there (Shift Up = Y: [3] = 7 in the
# channel's in-game table) is back, and on the Controls page.  Throttle
# bound to A in the first column takes the place of the trigger axis there
# (the axis goes off, runtime/dinput_pad.c bind_takes_axis).  Then a pad
# capture there is cancelled with the keyboard's Escape (the keyboard reader
# looks the key up with GetObjectInfo(DIPH_BYOFFSET) in its action map), so
# B afterwards leaves the page instead of being bound.
